{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01720","headline":"杂曲歌辞 轻薄篇二首 二 · 僧贯休","name":"杂曲歌辞 轻薄篇二首 二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"木落萧萧，蛩鸣唧唧。\n不觉朱蔫脸红，霜劫鬓漆。\n世途多事，泣向秋日。\n方吟少壮不努力，老大徒伤悲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"僧贯休","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_01720.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_01720","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}